{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":354654,"duration_api_ms":355791,"num_turns":10,"result":"Now I have sufficient context. The RUNNING experiments in the registry (`gpqa_ds_importance_s020/s025/s030`, `gpqa_ds_random_s020`) plus implied random conditions are the \"planned\" experiments. Let me generate best-tier predictions calibrated against the completed `gpqa_ds_importance_s015` baseline.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: \"GPQA 全面复现 phase-dependent compound severity，且 strategy specificity 强于 MATH-500（17× vs 15-17×），形成 reasoning-complexity 梯度（GSM8K 2.3-3.8× < MATH-500 15-17× < GPQA 17×）。三 benchmark dose-response 完美单调（ρ=1.0），cross-benchmark gradient Pearson r=0.997。Reviewers 认可这一梯度作为 unified explanation：推理链越长，importance score 在低 sparsity phase 的判别力崩塌越严重，compound interaction 被放大得越多——random/recency 不受此影响。Triple dissociation（importance有gradient / random弱或NS / recency NS）在 GPQA 上同样成立，cross-architecture specificity差异被视为 interesting finding 而非 confound。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.20, n=198, quantile 3-phase segmentation\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      median_difference: 2.85\n      ii_low_median: 2.92\n      ii_mid_median: 0.38\n      ii_high_median: 0.035\n      median_ratio_low_high: 83.4\n      wilcoxon_p: 3.2e-34\n      cohens_dz: 0.92\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [2.41, 3.35]\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high\"\n      perplexity_low_both: 42.8\n      perplexity_high_both: 3.15\n      phase_stats_high_n_tokens: 479658\n      phase_stats_low_n_tokens: 465085\n    result_rationale: \"GPQA 问题的推理链平均长度是 MATH-500 的 2.0-2.5×（GPQA ~6000 tokens vs MATH-500 ~2500 tokens）。更长的推理链意味着 low-sparsity phase 占比更大、attention score 判别力在该 phase 内承受更多累积退化。s020 时 head pruning 已经开始削弱 importance score 的 Gini coefficient（DS s020 global Gini delta = -0.0404），在 GPQA 更长的 low-sparsity phase 内，这种累积 discrimination collapse 导致更多 token 被错误 evict，II 放大为 MATH-500 同 sparsity 的 ~2.35× (2.85/1.215)。该倍率略低于 s015 的 2.42× 是因为 s020 compound interaction 已进入非线性区间、GPQA 的超长序列在 KV cache 层面有 marginally 更多 recovery redundancy。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GPQA Phase Gradient s020\"\n        content: |\n          Phase     | II median | 95% CI        | n_segments\n          high      | 0.035     | [0.028, 0.042]| ~6200\n          mid       | 0.38      | [0.32, 0.45]  | ~2200\n          low       | 2.92      | [2.55, 3.35]  | ~5100\n    figures_description:\n      - \"GPQA dose-response curve at s020 overlaid with MATH-500 s020 (normalized), showing GPQA's steeper gradient\"\n    analysis: \"s020 确认 GPQA phase gradient 强于 MATH-500 同 sparsity（median_diff 2.85 vs 1.215, ratio 2.35×）。effect size d_z=0.92 在 n=198 下功效充分（power>0.999）。与 s015 结果合并确认单调递增趋势：0.947→2.85。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.25, n=198, quantile 3-phase segmentation\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      median_difference: 7.2\n      ii_low_median: 7.45\n      ii_mid_median: 1.52\n      ii_high_median: 0.098\n      median_ratio_low_high: 76.0\n      wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-40\n      cohens_dz: 1.08\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [6.15, 8.40]\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high\"\n      perplexity_low_both: 88.5\n      perplexity_mid_both: 18.6\n      perplexity_high_both: 4.82\n    result_rationale: \"s025 是 discrimination collapse 加速的临界区间——MATH-500 上 Gini delta 从 s020 的 -0.040 跳到 s025 的 -0.065（61% 增幅）。GPQA 更长推理链在此 sparsity 承受更多 cascade failure：每个被错误 evict 的 token 影响后续更多 token 的 attention pattern，链越长 cascade 越深。GPQA/MATH-500 乘数从 s015 的 2.42× 衰减至 s025 的 1.81×（7.2/3.986），因为 MATH-500 在 s025 自身已处于强 interaction 区间（median_diff 3.99），两者开始向共同的 'severe degradation' 上界收敛。Cohen's d_z 达到 1.08 表明 phase gradient 在此 sparsity 处于最强判别力。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GPQA Phase Gradient s025\"\n        content: |\n          Phase     | II median | 95% CI         | Perplexity (both)\n          high      | 0.098     | [0.072, 0.128] | 4.82\n          mid       | 1.52      | [1.18, 1.92]   | 18.6\n          low       | 7.45      | [6.30, 8.75]   | 88.5\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Phase × sparsity heatmap for GPQA showing s025 as the inflection point where low-phase II exceeds 5.0\"\n    analysis: \"s025 是 paper narrative 的关键支撑点：GPQA median_diff=7.2 明显超越 MATH-500 s025 的 3.99（1.8×），而 MATH-500 的 s025 已经是该 benchmark 的强效应区间。这证实了推理链长度调制 compound severity 的核心假设。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.30, n=198, quantile 3-phase segmentation\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      median_difference: 12.0\n      ii_low_median: 12.35\n      ii_mid_median: 3.28\n      ii_high_median: 0.18\n      median_ratio_low_high: 68.6\n      wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-42\n      cohens_dz: 1.15\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [10.2, 14.8]\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high\"\n      perplexity_low_both: 185.3\n      perplexity_mid_both: 42.6\n      perplexity_high_both: 7.15\n      gpqa_dose_response_rho: 1.0\n      gpqa_dose_response_perm_p: 0.0417\n    result_rationale: \"s030 是 extreme sparsity，30% head 被 prune 后 importance score 的判别力严重崩塌（DS Gini delta = -0.0806）。GPQA 的超长推理链（~6000 tokens）在 low-sparsity phase 内需要 attention 维持大量远距离依赖，而 s030 pruning 使得 importance scoring 近乎随机——大量 critical token 被错误 evict，产生 catastrophic cascade。median_diff=12.0 处于 best tier 的 [6, 15] 中心，GPQA/MATH-500 乘数降至 1.41×（12.0/8.48），反映两者在极端 sparsity 下均接近 ceiling（模型在 low phase 已几乎完全 degenerate，进一步加剧的空间有限）。median_ratio_low_high 从 s015 的 75.2 降至 68.6，因 high phase 的 II 也开始上升（floor effect 被突破）。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GPQA Full Dose-Response (importance)\"\n        content: |\n          Sparsity | median_diff | 95% CI        | d_z  | Wilcoxon p\n          s015     | 0.947       | [0.88, 1.03]  | 0.81 | 1.4e-29\n          s020     | 2.85        | [2.41, 3.35]  | 0.92 | 3.2e-34\n          s025     | 7.2         | [6.15, 8.40]  | 1.08 | 8.1e-40\n          s030     | 12.0        | [10.2, 14.8]  | 1.15 | 2.5e-42\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-benchmark dose-response comparison (GSM8K / MATH-500 / GPQA) with 95% CI ribbons, showing GPQA's steepest gradient\"\n      - \"Cross-benchmark gradient correlation scatter plot (r=0.997)\"\n    analysis: \"s030 完成 GPQA 四点 dose-response 曲线，Spearman ρ=1.0 确认完美单调性。GPQA gradient 在绝对值上超越 MATH-500（12.0 vs 8.48），且 d_z 更大（1.15 vs 0.94），证实推理链长度正相关于 compound severity 的 phase gradient 强度。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.20, n=198, quantile 3-phase segmentation\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      median_difference: 0.038\n      ii_low_median: 0.052\n      ii_mid_median: 0.041\n      ii_high_median: 0.028\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.215\n      cohens_dz: 0.065\n      significant_bonferroni: false\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [-0.018, 0.095]\n      phase_gradient_direction: \"near-flat\"\n    result_rationale: \"Random masking 不依赖 attention score，因此不受 discrimination collapse 影响。s020 random 在 MATH-500 n=500 上已是 NS（median=0.032, p=0.28），GPQA 上同样 NS。虽然 GPQA 推理链更长（更多 token 被随机 evict），但随机 eviction 的 damage 在各 phase 内均匀分布——不存在 'low phase 更脆弱' 的选择性放大。median_diff=0.038 略高于 MATH-500 的 0.032 仅反映 GPQA 序列更长时随机删除的绝对影响略大，但远未达显著性。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GPQA Random s020 Phase Breakdown\"\n        content: |\n          Phase | II median | 95% CI          | Interpretation\n          high  | 0.028     | [-0.005, 0.062] | NS\n          mid   | 0.041     | [0.012, 0.078]  | NS\n          low   | 0.052     | [0.015, 0.098]  | NS\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Strategy comparison at s020: importance shows steep gradient (d_z=0.92) vs random flat (d_z=0.065)\"\n    analysis: \"Random s020 NS 确认 phase gradient 不是 phase segmentation artifact。如果 gradient 是 segmentation 本身的偏差，random masking 也应显示类似 gradient——实际 NS 排除此可能。imp/rand ratio 在 s020: 2.85/0.038 = 75×（MATH-500 同 sparsity 约 38×），GPQA 的 strategy specificity 更强。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s025\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.25, n=198, quantile 3-phase segmentation\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      median_difference: 0.42\n      ii_low_median: 0.58\n      ii_mid_median: 0.39\n      ii_high_median: 0.22\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.0032\n      cohens_dz: 0.18\n      significant_bonferroni: true\n      bonferroni_p: 0.0128\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [0.15, 0.72]\n      imp_rand_ratio_s025: 17.1\n    result_rationale: \"s025 是 random masking 的 onset threshold（MATH-500 上 DS random s025 median=0.257, Bonferroni p=0.006）。GPQA 上 random 同样在 s025 开始显著（p=0.003），但 effect size 极小（d_z=0.18, small）。这符合理论预期：当 25% head 被 prune 时，即使 random eviction 也会因 redundancy 不足导致少量 phase-dependent damage（low phase 的长距离依赖更脆弱）。但 importance/random ratio=17.1× 表明 importance eviction 的 phase gradient 远强于 random 的微弱 gradient——两者 mechanism 根本不同：importance 是 discrimination collapse 驱动的系统性偏差放大，random 是纯粹的 redundancy depletion。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Strategy Specificity at s025 (GPQA)\"\n        content: |\n          Strategy   | median_diff | d_z  | p (Bonf) | Interpretation\n          Importance | 7.2         | 1.08 | <1e-39   | Strong gradient\n          Random     | 0.42        | 0.18 | 0.013    | Weak gradient\n          Ratio      | 17.1×       | 6.0× | —        | Strategy-specific\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired comparison: importance vs random phase gradient at s025, violin plot showing distribution overlap\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA s025 imp/rand ratio=17.1× 与 MATH-500 的 15.5× 高度一致（略强），支持 GPQA≥MATH-500 specificity 叙事。Random 虽显著但 d_z 仅 0.18，不构成对 importance-specific 叙事的挑战。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.30, n=198, quantile 3-phase segmentation\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      median_difference: 0.70\n      ii_low_median: 1.05\n      ii_mid_median: 0.68\n      ii_high_median: 0.42\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.00085\n      cohens_dz: 0.22\n      significant_bonferroni: true\n      bonferroni_p: 0.0034\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [0.28, 1.18]\n      imp_rand_ratio_s030: 17.1\n      gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_overall: 17.1\n    result_rationale: \"s030 extreme sparsity 下 random masking 产生可测量的 phase gradient（d_z=0.22），因为 30% pruning 后即使 random eviction 也面临严重 redundancy 不足——low phase 的长距离 token 依赖被破坏概率更高。但 importance/random ratio 保持 17.1×，一致于 s025。这与 MATH-500 模式一致（DS n=500: imp_s030=8.48, rand_s030=0.51, ratio=16.6×）。GPQA 的 ratio 略高于 MATH-500（17.1 vs 16.6）验证了核心假设：推理链越长，discrimination collapse 在 importance eviction 中的放大效应越强，而 random 不受此影响，导致 specificity 随 reasoning complexity 递增。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Strategy Specificity Gradient\"\n        content: |\n          Benchmark | Reasoning depth | Imp/Rand ratio (s030) | Interpretation\n          GSM8K     | Short (~500 tok)| 2.8×                  | Weak specificity\n          MATH-500  | Medium (~2500)  | 16.6×                 | Strong specificity\n          GPQA      | Long (~6000)    | 17.1×                 | Strongest specificity\n      - name: \"Table: GPQA Complete Random Results\"\n        content: |\n          Sparsity | median_diff | d_z  | p (Bonf) | Significant\n          s020     | 0.038       | 0.07 | 0.86     | No\n          s025     | 0.42        | 0.18 | 0.013    | Yes (weak)\n          s030     | 0.70        | 0.22 | 0.003    | Yes (weak)\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-benchmark specificity bar chart showing monotonic increase in imp/rand ratio with reasoning depth\"\n      - \"Strategy × phase × benchmark 3D interaction plot (key paper figure)\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA random s030 完成 strategy specificity 分析。imp/rand=17.1× 略超 MATH-500 的 16.6×，但差异不大（可能在 CI 内重叠），核心贡献在于方向一致：GPQA ≥ MATH-500 >> GSM8K。这支持 unified explanation：推理链长度调制 discrimination collapse 的累积深度，从而调制 strategy specificity。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_cross_benchmark_gradient_synthesis\"\n    plan_id: \"cross_benchmark_synthesis\"\n    description: \"三 benchmark (GSM8K/MATH-500/GPQA) phase gradient 比较与 reasoning-complexity correlation 分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation: 0.997\n      specificity_gradient_monotonic: true\n      specificity_ordering: \"GPQA(17.1×) > MATH-500(16.6×) > GSM8K(2.8×)\"\n      dose_response_rho_gsm8k: 1.0\n      dose_response_rho_math500: 1.0\n      dose_response_rho_gpqa: 1.0\n      gradient_magnitude_ordering: \"GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K at each sparsity level\"\n      normalized_gradient_shape_correlation: 0.997\n      reasoning_depth_proxy:\n        gsm8k_avg_tokens: 500\n        math500_avg_tokens: 2500\n        gpqa_avg_tokens: 6000\n      specificity_vs_depth_spearman: 1.0\n    result_rationale: \"三个 benchmark 的 reasoning depth 形成自然梯度（GSM8K ~500 tokens, MATH-500 ~2500 tokens, GPQA ~6000 tokens），且 compound severity 的 phase gradient 和 strategy specificity 均与此深度正相关。Pearson r=0.997 来自三个 benchmark 在每个 sparsity level 的 importance median_diff 之间的相关性：它们的 dose-response 曲线形状高度相似（都是单调递增、sub-exponential growth），仅在 magnitude 上按 reasoning depth 缩放。Strategy specificity（imp/rand ratio）从 GSM8K 的 2.8× 到 MATH-500 的 16.6× 到 GPQA 的 17.1×，Spearman ρ=1.0。MATH-500 和 GPQA 的 specificity 接近（16.6 vs 17.1）而非 GPQA 远超 MATH-500，这是因为 specificity 的增长可能有 ceiling——一旦 reasoning depth 超过某阈值（~2000 tokens），discrimination collapse 的 phase-selective 放大已接近饱和。GSM8K 的显著偏低则因为短链推理中 attention score 的判别负担本身较轻，collapse 的影响被稀释。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Three-Benchmark Gradient Comparison (Importance)\"\n        content: |\n          Sparsity | GSM8K (DS) | MATH-500 (DS) | GPQA (DS) | GPQA/MATH ratio\n          s015     | 0.241      | 0.391          | 0.947     | 2.42×\n          s020     | 0.740      | 1.215          | 2.85      | 2.35×\n          s025     | 1.992      | 3.986          | 7.2       | 1.81×\n          s030     | 4.682      | 8.481          | 12.0      | 1.41×\n      - name: \"Table: Strategy Specificity vs Reasoning Complexity\"\n        content: |\n          Benchmark | Avg reasoning tokens | Imp/Rand ratio (s030) | Onset threshold\n          GSM8K     | ~500                 | 2.8×                  | s015+ (all sig)\n          MATH-500  | ~2500                | 16.6×                 | s025 (random onset)\n          GPQA      | ~6000                | 17.1×                 | s025 (random onset)\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5 (main paper): Three-benchmark dose-response overlay with 95% CI ribbons, log-scale y-axis, showing convergent shape with depth-scaled magnitude\"\n      - \"Fig 6 (main paper): Strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio) as function of reasoning depth, with GSM8K/MATH-500/GPQA as data points\"\n    analysis: \"Cross-benchmark synthesis 是 paper 的 capstone finding。三 benchmark 形成 reasoning-complexity 梯度解释：(1) Phase gradient 绝对值随 reasoning depth 递增（unified by discrimination collapse mechanism）；(2) Strategy specificity 随 reasoning depth 递增（GPQA≥MATH>>GSM8K），因为更长链→更深的 attention score 判别负担→collapse 时偏差累积更严重→importance eviction 退化更极端。(3) Random/recency 不受此影响→形成 triple dissociation。Reviewers 在 best tier 下认可这一 unified explanation 具备 sufficient mechanism evidence。\"\n\n  - name: \"expected_reviewer_assessment\"\n    plan_id: \"reviewer_synthesis\"\n    description: \"Best tier 下预期审稿评分与关键论证\"\n    expected_results:\n      expected_reviewer_avg_score: 3.75\n      novelty_score: 4.0\n      soundness_score: 3.5\n      significance_score: 3.5\n      presentation_score: 4.0\n      reviewer_1_score: 4.0\n      reviewer_2_score: 3.5\n      reviewer_3_score: 3.75\n      meta_reviewer_recommendation: \"weak accept\"\n    result_rationale: \"Best tier 下，论文具备以下强项让 reviewers 给出 3.5-4.0 分：(1) Triple dissociation（importance/random/recency）提供了超越 correlation 的 mechanism discrimination evidence，novelty 得分 4.0；(2) 三 benchmark × 三架构的泛化验证充分（但 7B-only 是明确 limitation）；(3) Recency control 作为 novel experimental design contribution 无先例，方法论贡献被认可；(4) Cross-benchmark gradient 提供了 unified explanation 而非零散 findings。主要扣分点：(a) 7B models only（significance 扣 0.5）；(b) 无 throughput/latency 数据（practical impact 扣 0.25）；(c) entropy collapse 在 Qwen 上不一致（mechanism 完整性扣 0.25）。Architecture-dependent specificity 被视为 interesting nuance 而非 confound——因为 within-importance gradient 在所有架构上 consistently large（d_z>0.8），差异仅在 imp/rand ratio 的 magnitude。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Anticipated Reviewer Score Breakdown\"\n        content: |\n          Criterion      | R1   | R2   | R3   | Rationale\n          Novelty        | 4.0  | 4.0  | 4.0  | Triple dissociation + cross-benchmark gradient novel\n          Soundness      | 3.5  | 3.5  | 3.5  | Strong stats, minor gap (QW entropy)\n          Significance   | 3.5  | 3.0  | 3.5  | 7B-only limits generalizability claim\n          Presentation   | 4.0  | 4.0  | 4.0  | Clear narrative, good figures\n          Overall        | 4.0  | 3.5  | 3.75 | —\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Best tier 预期 avg 3.75，meta-reviewer weak accept。关键 swing factor 是 R2 是否被 '7B-only' limitation 影响到 3.0 overall。Rebuttal 策略应预备：(1) 'scale limitation' 回应准备 LLaMA-8B 跨架构结果 + 计算资源声明；(2) 'practical impact' 回应准备 c5b pilot 结果 + future work framing。\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5d748d2a-c2e1-41a9-9f51-3674583dfc77","total_cost_usd":1.27466675,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":79525,"cache_read_input_tokens":592401,"output_tokens":17097,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":79525,"